WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:12.416
Guess what? Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom are coming to visit!

2
00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:17.349
Aunt Sunny says she has something very special to tell us!

3
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.689
I wonder what it is.

4
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.049
Hana: When are Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom coming?

5
00:00:23.051 --> 00:00:26.683
Mom: Next Saturday. They're going to stay with us.

6
00:00:26.684 --> 00:00:28.800
Bada: Where will they sleep?

7
00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:30.419
Mom: In Hana's room.

8
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.543
So you have to sleep with your brothers, okay?

9
00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:36.669
Hana: But Mom . . .

10
00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.816
Dad: Hana. Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom are our guests.

11
00:00:40.817 --> 00:00:44.118
Dad: We want them to feel welcome, right?

12
00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:47.997
Hana: Yes, Dad . . .

13
00:00:47.998 --> 00:00:50.009
Sunny: Hana, you've grown!

14
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:53.212
We've missed you so much.

15
00:00:53.213 --> 00:00:58.545
Hana: Me, too! I really enjoyed our trip to California last year.

16
00:00:58.546 --> 00:01:01.820
Tom: Next time you come, you'll meet someone new.

17
00:01:01.821 --> 00:01:05.396
Hana: New? What are you talking about?

18
00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.296
A new friend?

19
00:01:07.297 --> 00:01:14.889
Sunny: We'll tell you later.

20
00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.815
Bada: Hana! Read me this story!

21
00:01:17.816 --> 00:01:20.981
Hana: No, Bada! I'm going to sleep.

22
00:01:20.982 --> 00:01:23.164
Go to your own bed.

23
00:01:23.165 --> 00:01:25.839
Bada: But I'm not sleepy!

24
00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:29.458
Just this story, please?

25
00:01:29.459 --> 00:01:32.780
Hana: I wish I was sleeping in my own bed.

26
00:01:32.781 --> 00:01:35.823
Hana: Oh, Bada is so loud!

27
00:01:35.824 --> 00:01:42.045
I can't sleep!

28
00:01:42.046 --> 00:01:45.999
Hana: Oh, no! There's somebody in the kitchen!

29
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.524
Maybe it's a burglar.

30
00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:50.713
Hana: Should I wake Mom and Dad up?

31
00:01:50.714 --> 00:01:53.223
What about Bada and Hada?

32
00:01:53.224 --> 00:01:55.859
Hana: What if the burglar goes in there?

33
00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.639
Sunny: Who's there? Hana?

34
00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.782
Hana: Aunt Sunny! What are you doing here?

35
00:02:00.783 --> 00:02:03.686
Sunny: Did I wake you? Sorry, Hana.

36
00:02:03.687 --> 00:02:05.278
I was so hungry.

37
00:02:05.279 --> 00:02:09.599
Hana: Oh, maybe you didn't have enough for dinner.

38
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.682
Sunny: I had a lot for dinner.

39
00:02:11.683 --> 00:02:14.314
But I'm hungry again.

40
00:02:14.315 --> 00:02:16.901
Hana: Oh, should I wake Mom up?

41
00:02:16.902 --> 00:02:19.331
She can make you pancakes.

42
00:02:19.332 --> 00:02:21.229
Sunny: No, that's okay.

43
00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:23.178
I like sandwiches.

44
00:02:23.179 --> 00:02:29.940
Sunny: Remember—Uncle Tom said next time you visit, you'll meet someone new.

45
00:02:29.941 --> 00:02:32.276
Hana: Yes. Who is it?

46
00:02:32.277 --> 00:02:34.012
Do I know her?

47
00:02:34.013 --> 00:02:36.548
Sunny: It may be a girl or a boy.

48
00:02:36.549 --> 00:02:40.608
I don't know.

49
00:02:40.609 --> 00:02:44.308
Hana: You don't know who it is?

50
00:02:44.309 --> 00:02:49.561
Sunny: Not yet. Hana, I'm going to have a baby.

51
00:02:49.562 --> 00:02:51.529
Hana: A baby?

52
00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:54.136
Sunny: Tom and I want a family of our own.

53
00:02:54.137 --> 00:02:59.720
Sunny: We want children just like you, Bada, and Hada.

54
00:02:59.721 --> 00:03:05.298
Hana: Wow! A baby.

55
00:03:05.299 --> 00:03:08.571
Aunt Sunny is going to have a baby!

56
00:03:08.572 --> 00:03:10.847
I can't wait!

57
00:03:10.848 --> 00:03:14.060
She wants children just like us.

58
00:03:14.061 --> 00:03:16.070
She says we're special.

59
00:03:16.071 --> 00:03:18.638
I think so, too.
